<title>JAPAN: Fushiki Kairiku Unso - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fushiki Kairiku Unso - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996</p>
